# One token-gated motion command to a resource driver (e.g. the mock arm
# driver). Demonstrates the design noted in AcquireControl.srv's docstring:
# the same session token minted per execution (see
# Orchestrator.current_execution_token()) is the one capability "put on
# every command this resource arbitrates" -- not just ui_control, but any
# hardware resource a resource-owning node registers control over.
uint8[16] token
string target   # opaque to the driver -- e.g. the Progress.phase that triggered this move
---
bool accepted
string message
